1. Check AUTO_CLINE_SETUP_DONE flag
   - If false: Exit with error
   - If true: Continue

2. Read initial configuration from .prompts/system.prmt

3. Check available files and proceed:
   - If the file '.prompts/stat/issues/new/draft.md' exists:
     Read instructions from .prompts/improve-draft-issue.prmt
   - If the file '.prompts/stat/issues/new/issue.md' exists:
     Read instructions from .prompts/new-issue.prmt
   - If neither file exists:
     Exit with "No task found" error